       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DYNAMIC-FEEDBACK.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FEEDBACK-MOMENTUM-PROOFS.
           05  WS-NON-INTERRUPT-FLOW-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-RESPONSE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOMENTUM-PRESERVE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STABILITY-CONVERGE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-FEEDBACK-SEAL-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DYNAMIC-FEEDBACK-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-FEEDBACK-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-FEEDBACK-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FLOW-AND-RESPONSE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MOMENTUM-AND-STABILITY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-FEEDBACK-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FLOW-AND-RESPONSE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NON-INTERRUPT-FLOW-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-RESPONSE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MOMENTUM-AND-STABILITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOMENTUM-PRESERVE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STABILITY-CONVERGE-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-FEEDBACK-PROOFS.
           IF WS-NON-INTERRUPT-FLOW-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DYNAMIC-RESPONSE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MOMENTUM-PRESERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STABILITY-CONVERGE-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-FEEDBACK-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-FEEDBACK-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-FEEDBACK-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-FEEDBACK-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-FEEDBACK-CODE.
